# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# repo-skeletor — root .gitignore
#
# Anything below here is intentionally NOT shipped to consumers when
# they "Use this template" on GitHub. Internal-only artifacts live
# alongside the public ones in this workspace tree but stay local.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Internal one-time runbook for the maintainer's own repo migration.
# Contains absolute Windows paths and one-time gh commands; serves
# zero purpose to downstream consumers.
REPO_RELAUNCH_RUNBOOK.md

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Build output (in case anyone runs the launcher from the root)
dist/
node_modules/
